      "talk": {
        "title": "Zero-Downtime Kubernetes Deployments on AWS with EKS",
        "speakers": [
          {
            "name": "Philip Miglinci",
            "role": "Co-Founder Glasskube",
            "photo": "https://cdn.sessionize.com/image/b6f5-200o200o2-4JoiJ6Scs9zxEt8qJ7pKeK.jpg",
            "bio": "Philip holds a Bachelor's degree in computer science and economics from the Vienna University of Technology and a Master's degree in Biomedical Engineering. In 2024 Philip co founded Glasskube, an Open Source Developer Tooling company that maintains among other projects an Open Source Package Manager for Kubernetes with over 3.000 stars. Before working on Glasskube, Philip helped build up the alerting infrastructure for firefighting organizations in Austria and Germany as CTO."
